title Target Skill Execution - Snapshot, Admission and Shared Events
' Source: pi-mono-java dfb90cac4e233e09a0b8f047f7e9f4682f5ad238.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/service/command/SkillCommandSource.java list/resolved.
